WEBVTT

00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,280
So tell us why cancer, I mean, you start off as a chiropractor and then here you are,

00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:12,960
you know, working with cancer patients and a few Lyme patients as well. So what happened there?

00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:19,680
Well, it was just, it was an experience. So I graduated as a chiropractor but really practiced as

00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:27,040
a functional medicine practitioner before that term existed, taking care of people with thyroid

00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:34,080
issues and hormonal problems and had adrenal function and things. I always studied about

00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:42,800
rife technology. So rife is a light sequencing generator and for some reason I was enthralled

00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:49,280
with that technology and he even had it and my machine picked out that I wanted to buy at some time

00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:55,120
but all I do about it was it was for cancer. So I wasn't seeing cancer patients at the time

00:00:56,080 --> 00:01:04,320
and then in the late 1990s one of my patients came in and she was diagnosed with breast cancer

00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:13,040
and both breasts and was given three months to live and did not want to do chemo irradiation. So

00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:19,600
she literally said, if you can't help me, I'd rather die and that's what I do. I should buy a rife

00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:24,800
machine and give this thing a shot. Well, she lived another 13 years and died of a heart attack.

00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:31,920
So it was in that process that God really opened the door and pushed me through

00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:40,080
and really revealed to me what I was supposed to be doing. So I loved chiropractic, I loved

00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:44,960
taking care of people but I do there was just something missing that I was supposed to do.

00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:54,000
A matter of fact, I graduated in 1986 and just felt that missing something for a number of years

00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:59,920
so I ended up selling my practice and my wife and at that time, four children. But in the full-time

00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:07,200
missionary work we worked on the Mexico and a mission in final school orphanage and God closed the door

00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:13,200
on that, put me back in practice. I just didn't know what it was to do but I was supposed to be doing

00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:26,720
until shark came along and that's really launched my new phone practice in taking care of people with

00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:32,800
kids.

